  kennel:{name:'Guard Dog Kennel',icon:'🐕',tiers:[125,200,300,450,650,900],txt:t=>['A guard dog (random breed, each with its own temperament) joins every stage: 5 hits, one back every 12s, bites 15% harder, 5% dodge. Anyone can stop to pet it (1.75s, no zombies near) to bring back a hit. If it goes down it\'s gone, and the kennel sends a new one 30s later. Eats 0.5 food and 0.5 water every camp.','Your dog takes 6 hits, gets one back every 10s, bites 30% harder and a little quicker, and has 10% dodge.','Your dog takes 7 hits, gets one back every 7s, bites 45% harder, 15% dodge.','Two dogs out at once: 8 hits each, bite 60% harder, 20% dodge.','LARGE BREEDS: 30% of the time a new dog is a big one (22% bigger): a Saint Bernard (2 more hits, stays close and shares the healing drink in its barrel, 8% of an ally\'s life every 6s) or a Cane Corso (1 more hit, bites 15% harder, +12% crit). Dogs bite 70% harder.','LARGE BREEDS 50% of the time, and dogs bite 80% harder.'][t-1]},   // 0.12.65 (Kyle): 4 tiers, two dogs at the top
  tower:{name:'Watchtower',icon:'🗼',tiers:[100,175,275,400],txt:t=>['Scouts the road ahead: each camp, pick 1 of 2 reports to shape the next stage (more ambulances, more loot, fewer zombies...).','3 reports to pick from.','3 reports, and every one is 50% stronger.','MAP TABLE: 4 reports to pick from, and you can follow TWO of them at once.'][t-1]},   /* 0.12.105 (Kyle): the Map Table idea merged in as tier IV */
